espresso machine","delonghi coffee machine","delonghi espresso machine","espresso machine for home","how to make coffee","espresso","espresso shot","espresso tutorial","how to make espresso at home","delonghi espresso machine how to use","barista","barista training","espresso guide for beginners","Tomo Laca","European Coffee Trip"],"channelId":"UC3KGOt3IfrVxDNtz5o7H-5A","isOwnerViewing":false,"shortDescription":"Learn how to make coffee at home with the DeLonghi Dedica espresso machine. We will share how to make espresso, steam milk, and latte art for a cappuccino. We start with a simple routine using pre-ground coffee but then move to more advanced barista techniques to brew tasty coffee using specialty coffee beans.\n\n☕️ Say hello to Tomo on Instagram 👉 https://www.instagram.com/specialtycoffeebarista/\n⭐ Find the best coffee shops in Europe 👉 https://europeancoffeetrip.com/mobile-app\n📺  Watch our documentary about the AeroPress ► https://geni.us/AeropressMovie 👍\n\n-- FEATURED COFFEE TOOLS --\n(When available, we use affiliate links and may earn a commission!)\n\n► DeLonghi Dedica EC685: https://geni.us/qbFqa (Amazon)\n► Comandante C40 Grinder: https://geni.us/IzU3 (Amazon/Prima)\n► Acaia Scale: https://geni.us/Bet04 (Amazon/Prima)\n► Loveramics cups: https://www.loveramics.com/pages/coffee\n► Specialty coffee beans: https://www.beberrycoffee.cz\n\n🛠 All coffee gear \u0026 tools we use in our office: https://kit.co/europeancoffeetrip\n\n** OUR SPONSORS **\n► Victoria Arduino - http://www.victoriaarduino.com\n► AeroPress, Inc. - https://aeropress.com\n► Comandante - http://www.comandantegrinder.com\n► Cropster - https://www.cropster.com\n► Puqpress - https://www.puqpress.com\n► Hard Beans - https://hardbeans.com \n\n** STAY IN TOUCH **\n► https://www.europeancoffeetrip.com\n► https://www.instagram.com/europeancoffeetrip\n► https://www.facebook.com/europeancoffeetrip\n► https://twitter.com/EuroCoffeeTrip\n\nTimestamps:\n0:00 Better Coffee on Cheap Home Espresso M