: https://www.loveramics.com/pages/coffee\n► Specialty coffee beans: https://www.beberrycoffee.cz\n\n🛠 All coffee gear \u0026 tools we use in our office: https://kit.co/europeancoffeetrip\n\n** OUR SPONSORS **\n► Victoria Arduino - http://www.victoriaarduino.com\n► AeroPress, Inc. - https://aeropress.com\n► Comandante - http://www.comandantegrinder.com\n► Cropster - https://www.cropster.com\n► Puqpress - https://www.puqpress.com\n► Hard Beans - https://hardbeans.com \n\n** STAY IN TOUCH **\n► https://www.europeancoffeetrip.com\n► https://www.instagram.com/europeancoffeetrip\n► https://www.facebook.com/europeancoffeetrip\n► https://twitter.com/EuroCoffeeTrip\n\nTimestamps:\n0:00 Better Coffee on Cheap Home Espresso Machine\n0:25 DeLonghi Dedica EC685 Overview\n1:30 Espresso workflow with pre-ground coffee\n2:02 Espresso workflow with specialty coffee\n7:38 How to steam milk on DeLonghi Dedica\n10:26 Better espresso with bottomless portafilter\n12:30 Better latte art and milk steaming\n14:26 Final thoughts on DeLonghi Dedica EC685"},"lengthSeconds":"917","ownerProfileUrl":"http://www.youtube.com/@EuropeanCoffeeTrip","externalChannelId":"UC3KGOt3IfrVxDNtz5o7H-5A","isFamilySafe":true,"availableCountries":["AD","AE","AF","AG","AI","AL","AM","AO","AQ","AR","AS","AT","AU","AW","AX","AZ","BA","BB","BD","BE","BF","BG","BH","BI","BJ","BL","BM","BN","BO","BQ","BR","BS","BT","BV","BW","BY","BZ","CA","CC","CD","CF","CG","CH","CI","CK","CL","CM","CN","CO","CR","CU","CV","CW","CX","CY","CZ","DE","DJ","DK","DM","DO","DZ","EC","EE","EG","EH","ER","ES","ET","FI","FJ","FK","FM","FO","FR","GA","GB","GD","GE","GF","GG","GH","GI","GL","GM","GN","GP","GQ","GR","GS","GT","GU","GW","GY","HK","HM","HN","HR","HT","HU","ID","IE","IL","IM","IN","IO","IQ","IR","IS","IT","JE","JM","JO","JP","KE","KG","KH","KI","KM","KN","KP","KR","KW","KY","KZ","LA","LB","LC","LI","LK","LR","LS","LT","LU","LV","LY","MA","MC","MD","ME","MF","MG","MH","MK","ML","MM","MN","MO","MP","MQ","MR","MS","MT","MU","MV","MW"