e DeLonghi Dedica espresso machine. We will share how to make espresso, steam milk, and latte art for a cappuccino. We start with a simple routine using pre-ground coffee but then move to more advanced barista techniques to brew tasty coffee using specialty coffee beans.\n\n☕️ Say hello to Tomo on Instagram 👉   / specialtycoffeebarista  \n⭐ Find the best coffee shops in Europe 👉 https://europeancoffeetrip.com/mobile...\n📺  Watch our documentary about the AeroPress ► https://geni.us/AeropressMovie 👍\n\n-- FEATURED COFFEE TOOLS --\n(When available, we use affiliate links and may earn a commission!)\n\n► DeLonghi Dedica EC685: https://geni.us/qbFqa (Amazon)\n► Comandante C40 Grinder: https://geni.us/IzU3 (Amazon/Prima)\n► Acaia Scale: https://geni.us/Bet04 (Amazon/Prima)\n► Loveramics cups: https://www.loveramics.com/pages/coffee\n► Specialty coffee beans: https://www.beberrycoffee.cz\n\n🛠 All coffee gear \u0026 tools we use in our office: https://kit.co/europeancoffeetrip\n\n** OUR SPONSORS **\n► Victoria Arduino - http://www.victoriaarduino.com\n► AeroPress, Inc. - https://aeropress.com\n► Comandante - http://www.comandantegrinder.com\n► Cropster - https://www.cropster.com\n► Puqpress - https://www.puqpress.com\n► Hard Beans - https://hardbeans.com \n\n** STAY IN TOUCH **\n► https://www.europeancoffeetrip.com\n►   / europeancoffeetrip  \n►   / europeancoffeetrip  \n►   / eurocoffeetrip  \n\nTimestamps:\n0:00 Better Coffee on Cheap Home Espresso Machine\n0:25 DeLonghi Dedica EC685 Overview\n1:30 Espresso workflow with pre-ground coffee\n2:02 Espresso workflow with specialty coffee\n7:38 How to steam milk on DeLonghi Dedica\n10:26 Better espresso with bottomless portafilter\n12:30 Better latte art and milk steaming\n14:26 Final thoughts on DeLonghi Dedica EC685","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":350,"length":28,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CJQCEM2rARgBIhMIu9zAlsiJlgMV0296BR3cMyBuSN3XhNGYsIzuiQHKAQRXf3Mp","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":